        "created_at": "2017-04-02T10:29:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>Ambuscade opened with the cloak, plating, rocket launcher, and a handgun, then played snatch and grab. &nbsp;Cosmic passed out swords to Vis and Unity on turn one, and between those and a couple of one shots from Legacy and the Sentinels, I had him down to just the plating for the second round.</p><p>Second round, he played and buried a trap.Vis suggestioned the gun back on top.</p><p>I accidentally set off Ambuscade's bomb trying to rig his deck with a premonition in the third round, which cleared out all of the constructs I had played. Finished him off during the third environment turn when ghostly images gave me a thokk and a horrifying dichotomy.</p>",
